lus</h2><p class="fit">For clinics needing more help moving from existing records.</p><div class="price">₹49,000<span> + tax</span></div><p class="year">First year · Web-based access</p><div class="renewal"><strong>₹6,500 + tax / year</strong><span>Annual renewal from Year 2</span></div><ul><li>Up to 2 hours of guided system demo</li><li>Four 30-minute training sessions</li><li>Up to 4 hours of help within 60 days</li><li>Patient-record guidance or up to 4 hours of support</li></ul><a class="button " href="./#contact" aria-label="Book a demo to discuss Clinic Launch Plus">Discuss Launch Plus</a></article></section><aside class="rationale"><strong>Why Clinic Launch?</strong><p>For ₹5,000 more than Clinic Essential, your team receives a guided system demo, practical training and help during its first month of use.</p></aside><section class="scope"><h2>One software scope.<br>Different levels of help.</h2><div><p>Every package includes patient records, treatment episodes and session history, exercise and machine records, clinical notes and report files, treatment charges and payment tracking, patient access, and existing dashboards and reports.</p><div class="chips"><span>Use across multiple locations</span><span>First-year hosting included</span><span>Remote setup and training</span></div></div></section><section class="comparison"><div class="heading"><h2>Compare the included support.</h2><p>Launch services are one-time inclusions.</p></div><div class="desktop-compare"><table><caption style="position:absolute;clip-path:inset(50%);width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden">Setup, training and launch-service inclusions by package</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">What’s included</th><th scope="col">Clinic Essential</th><th scope="col">Clinic Launch</th><th scope="col">Clinic Launch Plus</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Current software modules and first-year hosting</th><td>Included</td><td>Included</td><td>Included</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Standard clinic and login setup</th><td>Included</td><td>Included</td><td>Included</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Guided system demo</th><td>System walkthrough during orientation</td><td>Up to 1 hour</td><td>Up to 2 hours</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Remote staff training</th><td>One 45-minute orientation</td><td>Two sessions of 30 minutes each</td><td>Four sessions of 30 minutes each</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Additional help after launch</th><td>Not included</td><td>Up to 2 hours within 30 days</td><td>Up to 4 hours within 60 days</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Existing patient-record assistance</th><td>Quoted separately</td><td>Quoted separately</td><td>Guidance or up to 4 hours of support</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="mobile-compare"><details><summary>Clinic Essential inclusions</summary><dl><div><dt>Current software modules and first-year hosting</dt><dd>Included</dd></div><div><dt>Standard clinic and login setup</dt><dd>Included</dd></div><div><dt>Guided system demo</dt><dd>System walkthrough during orientation</dd></div><div><dt>Remote staff training</dt><dd>One 45-minute orientation</dd></div><div><dt>Additional help after launch</dt><dd>Not included</dd></div><div><dt>Existing patient-record assistance</dt><dd>Quoted separately</dd></div></dl></details><details><summary>Clinic Launch inclusions</summary><dl><div><dt>Current software modules and first-year hosting</dt><dd>Included</dd></div><div><dt>Standard clinic and login setup</dt><dd>Included</dd></div><div><dt>Guided system demo</dt><dd>Up to 1 hour</dd></div><div><dt>Remote staff training</dt><dd>Two sessions of 30 minutes each</dd></div><div><dt>Additional help after launch</dt><dd>Up to 2 hours within 30 days</dd></div><div><dt>Existing patient-record assistance</dt><dd>Quoted separately</dd></div></dl></details><details><summary>Clinic Launch Plus inclusions</summary><dl><div><dt>Current software modules and first-year hosting</dt><dd>Included</dd></div><div><dt>Standard clinic and login setup</dt><dd>Included</dd></div><div><dt>Guided system demo</dt><dd>Up to 2 hours</dd></div><div><dt>Remote staff training</dt><dd>Four sessions of 30 minutes each</dd></div><div><dt>Additional help after launch</dt><dd>Up to 4 hours within 60 days</dd></div><div><dt>Existing patient-record assistance</dt><dd>Guidance or up to 4 hours of support</dd></div></dl></details></div></section><section class="terms-section" aria-labelledby="terms-heading"><div class="heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Setup, renewal and additional help</p><h2 id="terms-heading">Know what your package covers.</h2></div></div><div class="terms"><article class="term-card"><span class="term-number">01</span><h3>Remote implementation</h3><p>Your clinic team can use the same web-based system across multiple locations. Training and implementation assistance are remote.</p></article><article class="term-card"><span class="term-number">02</span><h3>Renewal from Year 2</h3><p>₹6,500 + tax per year covers standard hosted software continuation. The additional setup and training in higher packages are one-time inclusions.</p></article><article class="term-card"><span class="term-number">03</span><h3>Additional work</h3><p>Additional training, complex migration, new features and clinic-specific development are quoted separately.</p></article></div></section></div><section class="cta"><div class="wrap cta-inner"><div class="cta-copy"><p class="eyebrow">See the system in action</p><h2>See how it could work<br>for your clinic.</h2><p>Book a product demonstration to see registration, repeat treatment sessions, patient history and payments connected in My Physio Saathi.</p><p class="cta-contact">Tejas P Mehta | <a href="tel:+919825647083">Call: +91 98256 47083</a></p></div><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button solid" href="./#contact">Book a 20-minute demo</a></div></div></section></main><?php require __DIR__.'/includes/footer.php'; ?></body></html>